### Login (JWT for the protected /api/** calls below)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jwt.gate@eh8s.local",
  "password": "eh8s-dev-pass1"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Governance without Bearer must be 401
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC

### Governance for a wallet that is neither owner nor signer must be 403
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance?walletPubkey=U9mzuiHMVUsCw9BLKGibq55BPZuLaxipnvKFvn76Vjq
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Governance for the owner: initialized=false, maxSigners=5, governancePda 3ZH4ig...
GET http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance?walletPubkey=7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Build init_governance: 2 of 2 (owner signs next in the wallet)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/init/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "signers": ["7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC", "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"],
  "threshold": 2
}

### Non-owner init build must be 403
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/init/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU",
  "signers": ["YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"],
  "threshold": 1
}

### Duplicate signers must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/init/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "signers": ["YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU", "YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"],
  "threshold": 1
}

### Threshold above the signer count must be 400
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/init/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "signers": ["YmTYQJifjP2DawdxDUYuNCZJ5to9ge5nNGaWGW2ozJU"],
  "threshold": 2
}

### Forged init confirm must be 400 (verifier rejects an unknown signature)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/init/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "signers": ["7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC"],
  "threshold": 1,
  "txSignature": "5VERv8NMvzbJMEkV8xnrLkEaWRtSz9CosKDYjCJjBRnbJLgp8uirBgmQpjKhoR4tjF3ZpRzrFmBV6UjKdiSZkQUW"
}

### Propose before init must be 409
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/governance/proposals/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "kind": "withdraw",
  "amountUsdc": "1"
}

### Direct treasury withdraw build still works while governance is not initialized
POST http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/owner/treasury/withdraw/build
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "walletPubkey": "7QVKJjAD4AwZzgSNuDsF7ZSKS8PpYiRfGSvGu9h1DUuC",
  "amountUsdc": "0.01"
}
